WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.300
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.790
<i>The Shadow Lord's reign,</i>

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:04.000
<i>and Lief's adventure with his friends finally came to
an end, thanks to the power of the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:09.430
<i>The liberated people of Deltora cheered
with joy as they welcomed their new king.</i>

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:12.500
<i>The young king's name is Lief.</i>

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:16.500
<i>The Belt's gems emitted seven blinding lights,</i>

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:24.200
<i>blessing the rebirth of the Kingdom of
Deltora with justice, love and courage.</i>

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.200
What is the king doing?

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.100
Where on earth is he?!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.900
Well, he hasn't been seen since this morning.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.900
Wh-When was the last guard change?

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:01.100
I'm not sure.

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:04.700
Could it be that he's going out on his own again?

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.300
Most likely, yes.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.500
This must be troublesome for you two as well.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:15.000
To think that he would
sneak out of his own palace...

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:21.380
It would appear that staying inside
the palace doesn't suit our young king.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:25.000
Really, it's no cause for concern.

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:33.600
I wonder what I should cook for dinner...?

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.400
This looks delicious! I'll take one!

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.890
You can take this one too.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.360
It looks great on you.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.500
Are you sure it's okay to
be away from the palace?

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.500
I feel more comfortable here.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.300
You feel the same way, right Jasmine?

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:13.600
Yeah, pretty much.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.510
Even eating over there is a bit much...

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:37.370
The king begins his first dish!

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.960
Your face back then was hilarious!

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.210
It was completely over the top!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:54.300
I want to be able to relax when I'm eating!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:05:00.000
I suppose the palace does feel a bit too formal.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.720
I'm just not suited to it at all.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:06.400
Well, it's good that peace has
returned to Deltora at least.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:10.500
But, is this really true peace?

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:12.500
Actually, no...

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:13.730
What?

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:19.500
I just wonder what I should
be doing now that I'm king.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:25.100
Even after becoming king, you're still you.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.010
You should live the way you feel is right.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.250
Mother...

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.000
Hey, where are we going?

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.500
I'm not headed anywhere in particular,

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.990
I just want to have a look around the city.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.600
These apples look delicious!

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:52.600
What's going on?

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:09.700
It's an Ol!

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:14.000
Weren't all the Ols exterminated
when the Shadow Lord was banished?!

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:42.600
Remember this.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:45.200
Not all of us have been exterminated.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.000
No way...

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.900
Are you alright, Lief?

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:07.900
Yeah.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:12.490
But, the matter that's been
bothering me has become reality.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:17.100
I'm hailed as the king now,

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:20.800
but even in this city, there are still Ols at large.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:27.240
Peace has yet to be truly restored in the kingdom.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.200
You may be right...

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:43.400
I have heard the news.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.400
It seems that there was some
kind of commotion in the city.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.900
I am very glad to see that you're safe.

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.900
What happened?

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:55.600
There was an Ol.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.400
Are you certain of this?

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:02.030
Yes. It was a foul-looking monster.

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:06.000
Shit. They are still lurking around so close by...

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:10.000
I thought that the Shadow Lord's servants
had been banished along with him.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:13.500
Does this mean that we've
only banished him temporarily?

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:15.100
We will defeat him.

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:20.400
We can't just lose this state of
peace that we've finally achieved!

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.050
Lief, you...

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:24.800
I will go.

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:28.100
I can't just sit by idly in the palace!

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.800
W-We cannot allow this, my king.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:38.800
He's right. Our protocol is to have his royal
highness retreat to safety immediately.

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:41.800
Then, should I just leave the Ols be?!

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:43.700
W-Well...

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:45.700
We have no choice but to defeat them!

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:47.500
Calm yourself, Lief!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.400
It's not that I don't understand how you feel.

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:57.600
But, you are now an essential
part of this kingdom and its people.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.400
I will ask you to refrain from such rash actions.

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.100
Doom.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:06.400
Don't be so harsh! Just let Lief do as he likes!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:11.100
Deltora must not lose its king again.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:18.110
You both clearly saw what happened to this
kingdom after we lost our king the last time.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.200
Have there been any changes in the city?

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:45.880
No.

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:56.000
We certainly gave Lief an earful, but I can
understand how he feels about the Ols.

00:09:57.100 --> 00:10:00.900
However, he has become king now.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:03.400
The King of Deltora.

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:07.200
I don't think he will just obediently
heed our warnings, though.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.300
Is it really alright for you to
not return to the palace?

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:26.700
Yes, it's fine.

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:28.700
Your mother has gone back there, hasn't she?

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:29.800
That's right.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:31.700
What are you going to do about food?

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:34.300
You haven't eaten anything since then.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.000
Shut up, will you...

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.000
Can't you just give me some peace and quiet?

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:42.400
What's your problem?! I'm here
showing concern for you and all!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.400
I want some time alone to think.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.700
Is that so? Then you can go right ahead.

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:49.100
Let's go, Filli.

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:30.800
I'm sorry, Jasmine.

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:33.420
But this is my problem.

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:37.920
What I have to do right now is...

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:06.700
So, Lief never came back last night?

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.300
It would appear not.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.800
Honestly.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.100
For a king, he sure has a lot of free time.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.000
Indeed.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.100
But, he must have had a lot to think about.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:22.200
I'm sure his thoughts are as vast as the distance
you travelled with him across the kingdom.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:31.300
We cannot see all of what the future holds.

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:36.390
If we remain here, we may develop an
illusion of the world being peaceful.

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:41.800
But with what Lief has seen on his journeys,
he must have learned not to be so easily misled.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:08.900
The previous kings always stayed in the
palace, protected by their servants.

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:17.380
They had no idea of what was happening to the city,
the country, or even the people living in it.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:32.800
That was the opening that
the Shadow Lord exploited.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.700
I can't stay in the palace.

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.500
I must not!

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:35.600
I'm still not too far from the
palace and the city, and yet,

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.300
this forest is really creepy.

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:44.000
Not all of the Ols have been killed.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.720
I can't just leave them be.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.810
Jasmine, Barda!

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:56.000
How cold of you to go out on your own like that.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.800
That's right, Lief.

00:14:57.800 --> 00:14:59.400
But why are you both...

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.600
Honestly.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:03.600
How long do you think
we've been travelling together?

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:06.600
We can read your movements pretty well by now.

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:08.600
It's you, after all.

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.540
You wouldn't just leave the Ols alone.

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.400
So the group is back together, huh?

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:17.500
Are you unsatisfied?

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.000
That's unexpected.

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:22.400
Now, let's go!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.400
Yeah.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:24.430
Yes.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.700
You must be happy, Filli.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.800
We're returning to our beloved forest.

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:04.130
Lief...

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:16.100
Come to think of it, Jasmine wasn't with us
here when we had just begun our journey.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.550
That's true.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.500
But, it sure was a surprise,

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.400
back when we first met you.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:22.900
Oh, why is that?

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.400
We wondered if you were actually a girl.

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:30.800
How rude! Not every girl has to wear
pretty dresses and act all ladylike!

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:33.000
I suppose you're right.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:40.700
During our journey, you always took
care of food preparation for us, Jasmine.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.000
Oh, that's right.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.300
Thank you for yesterday.

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:48.400
Huh?

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.900
The apple.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:52.200
A-Ah, that thing.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:55.300
I was actually pretty hungry back then.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:56.600
You really saved me.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.700
Well I'm glad to hear it.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.670
What's wrong, you two?

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:22.900
What's this 'true heir' crap? Arrogant kid.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:24.800
This forest will be...

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:26.220
your graveyard!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.700
You stupid brat!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.600
Come, Filli and Kree, you should join in too.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:47.600
Okay!

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:49.700
I will tear you to pieces!

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.900
I've always hated you all along!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.100
You were always such a goody two shoes!

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.500
'The king'? Know your place!

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:00.700
You don't even have an ounce
of our Shadow Lord's power!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:04.000
Could it be... all of you,

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.600
are actually Ols?!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.100
Bingo.

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:09.000
You're a pretty dense kid.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:14.400
How ironic, heading off to kill Ols, only to be
killed by Ols disguised as your companions!

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.600
Let's begin, Your Majesty.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:21.000
Deltora is ours!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.600
<i>How could this be?
How could I not have noticed?</i>

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:30.950
<i>Ols can change their appearance with ease!</i>

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.300
It's over, Your Majesty.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:45.200
The Shadow Lord will rule over Deltora once more.

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:47.550
Die!

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:52.100
Hey you!

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:54.900
I've never made that kind of face!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.000
Jasmine!

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.430
Are you alright, Lief?

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:00.980
Barda!

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.500
We were so damn close!

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.400
What an annoying bunch!

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:08.180
Don't get in our way!

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:12.400
Honestly Lief, get with it!

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:13.500
Yeah, I know.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.900
We will be your opponents!

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:22.300
We won't let you lay a finger on Lief!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.170
No, I will fight too!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.920
Together, now and forever more!

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:31.300
Now we're on the back foot.

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:39.400
After all, there's three of you now.

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:46.200
Lief,

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.100
don't ever go out by yourself again, okay?

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:52.800
There is no need to invite danger by going alone!

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:53.780
Yeah!

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.300
Is the Shadow Lord...

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:06.880
Is the Shadow Lord setting
his sights on Deltora again?

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:09.130
And what if he is?

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.200
Can you do anything about it?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:14.130
Lief!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:23.900
I will not allow the Shadow Lord
to do with Deltora as he pleases!

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:48.400
Lief...

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:52.900
Don't be reckless.

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:54.400
We are here with you.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:58.000
That's right. With the three of us
together, we can accomplish anything.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.300
Barda,

00:20:59.300 --> 00:20:59.970
Jasmine.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:05.600
I'm sorry for being selfish.

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:37.300
I realised something while
I was living in the palace.

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:41.600
A king really shouldn't just sit
around in his fortress of solitude.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:47.900
It's exactly <i>because</i> he is king that
he must understand his country,

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:50.700
and witness it with his own eyes.

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:57.500
But, that doesn't mean he should be on his own.

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.900
Because a king...

00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:01.400
because I...

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:04.700
need friends that I can trust.

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:40.460
Bye-bye, thank you! The memories that we shared

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:45.550
are like a never-fading diamond

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:50.550
Non-stop, I'm not going to hit the brakes

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:55.640
I have to continue making this album

00:22:56.310 --> 00:23:00.980
Three springtimes have passed since then

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.320
but I still remember you

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:11.780
In this ever-changing city landscape

00:23:12.070 --> 00:23:16.160
I'm going out today, wearing a new pair of shoes

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:20.210
in search of tomorrow

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:24.710
In this corner of the world

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:30.420
it really is a miracle that we met each other

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:34.800
It's great to know that today and tomorrow

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:37.930
we will be seeing each other countless times

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:40.310
Thank you

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:44.900
Let's chase after our hopes and dreams

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:50.740
and with a deep breath, say "good morning" to the sun

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:56.280
Our hearts feel the time passing by, so hold me tight

00:23:56.280 --> 00:24:00.040
and we can start running towards our next adventure

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:10.000
Just as I thought, Lief can't
do anything without me around.

00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:12.200
Barda alone can't be relied on.

00:24:12.600 --> 00:24:14.900
But, this works well.

00:24:14.900 --> 00:24:19.100
I was getting bored in the palace, too.

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:22.300
I know! Why don't we go
to the Forests of Silence?

00:24:22.300 --> 00:24:26.720
Filli and Kree said they wanted
to see their homes again, too.

00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:29.900
Next time, 'Jasmine Returns to the Forest'.

00:24:28.820 --> 00:24:34.820
Jasmine Returns to the Forest

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:34.810
Wh-What?! Doom followed me into the
forest, and now I'm alone with him?!

00:24:49.790 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
